[SSR]
UID: SSR-087
TITLE: Degraded reaction switches only the mapped safe-output groups and keeps them until the power cycle
STAGE: 1
ASIL: B
STATUS: implemented
VERIFICATION: test, board
REVIEW_STATUS: accepted
CODE: >>>
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/src/safeSupervisor/SafeSupervisor.cpp :: degradeDeviceFault
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/src/safeSupervisor/SafeSupervisor.cpp :: enterDegraded
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/src/safeSupervisor/SafeSupervisor.cpp :: holdDegradedGroups
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/src/safeSupervisor/SafeSupervisor.cpp :: startDegraded
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/include/safeSupervisor/Degraded.h :: onStart
ecu/safety/safeSupervisor/src/safeSupervisor/DegradedRte.cpp :: readGroups
platforms/s32k1xx/port/safety/safeIo/src/safeIo/SafeStateDegraded.cpp :: enterDegradedState
<<<
NOTE: >>>
SYS-117, doc/safety/partner-and-degraded.md part B (decisions B1-B6 of 2026-09-29, each the recommended
variant). Realisation: reaction SD in SafeSupervisor::handle() (DEVICE_FAULT today, the only event of the
closed list NX_SAFE_DEGRADABLE_EVENTS in safeSupervisor/Degraded.h); a group is a set of entries of the one safe
outputs table (SM-23), walked by SafeState::enterDegradedState() of the family port; latch with inverted copy in
the protected RAM, record in no-init RAM (.noinit.safeDegraded, key and check word like the reset-loop record of
SYS-43), re-applied in startResetLoopLimit() from main() before the BSP; RTE targets safety.degraded,
safety.degraded.<GROUP>, safety.qlf.degraded (tools/rtegen). The error memory gets the degradation through a DTC
that samples such a port. Compiled only into a project with a mapping; every other project keeps its reactions
unchanged (the object code of the demo's supervisor is the same). Host tests with fault injection and 21
mutants; board run open. Known limits (fmea.md SM-23, SYS-117 residuals): the gate-driver enables join the
groups with IO-45; between the PWM driver's initialisation after a safety reset and the first safety cycle, and
between a release of the timer's output control by another path and the next safety cycle, a degraded group is
not forced (at most one safety cycle).
<<<
