[CLAUSE]
UID: SSR-087(a)
STATEMENT: >>>
For an event on the safe supervisor's closed list of degradable events that the project maps to
safe-output groups, the safe supervisor shall drive only the outputs of those groups to their safe state, and
then latch the groups, record them in memory that survives a reset, and report them - without a reset, without
limp home and without entering S1 while another group still works.
<<<
