UID: SSR-087(b)
STATEMENT: >>>
A device fault shall be degraded only if its report is well-formed, its fault class is not a wrong or
unknown part, it names the bus configured for the device, and - while the safe supervisor regards that bus as
lost - every device on the bus is mapped (then the groups of all of them are degraded); every other device
fault shall keep its fail-safe reaction.
<<<
